# ArduRover on gz's port_rover (models/port_rover), loaded after the SITL
# defaults and the chart's files/rover.parm: what the model is, not what the
# fleet wants of it.
# Full throttle is 10 m/s at the wheels, so 40 % cruises at 4 m/s.
CRUISE_SPEED 4
CRUISE_THROTTLE 40
SPEED_MAX 10
WP_SPEED 4
# Steering is +-30 degrees on a 2.4 m wheelbase: at speed v a full lock turns
# v * tan(30) / 2.4 rad/s. Steering is scaled down above 2 m/s, so the
# feed-forward that asks for the turn rate it gets is about 2.4 / (2 tan 30).
MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE 2
ATC_STR_RAT_FF 2.1
ATC_STR_RAT_P 0.3
ATC_STR_RAT_I 0.3
TURN_RADIUS 4.2
